    "脚本保存的数据（如 BoxJS 设置、登录信息）都会被删除，无法恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything scripts have saved (such as BoxJS settings and sign-in data) will be deleted and can't be restored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "腳本儲存的資料（如 BoxJS 設定、登入資訊）都會被刪除，無法復原。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
